# Code\ is this app's git repository and the ONLY folder that goes on GitHub ("push to github.bat").
# Build\, Website\ and Resources\ are beside it, so they are never in it.

# Never public: keys, passwords, shared secrets. The real values live in *.local.* files (or .env) that the build
# uses when they are there; the repository has a blank *.example.* next to each.
*.local.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not ours to publish: third-party / Microsoft binaries and tools the build copies in (each app lists its own
# below; README.md says where to get them), and the owner's own data, saves and test files.

# Build output and caches
build/
dist/
bin/
obj/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.user
.vs/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Media Countdowns (Manager\, Notifier\, Relay\)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Never public: the relay's address and shared secret are baked into Patrick's builds from
# Manager\src\relaysecret.local.h (blank Manager\src\relaysecret.example.h is committed).
# Relay\.env holds the relay server's real TMDB/IGDB keys, shared secret, admin password and
# DuckDNS token (Relay\.env.example shows its shape). Both are covered by the rules at the top.

# The other editions: Editions\Microsoft Store\ is a separate private product with its own git
# repository (and its own copy of the secret); Editions\Android\ has a TMDB key in its source.
Editions/

# Qt Creator / CMake / Ninja output and per-user files (build-app.bat builds in %TEMP%)
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
*_autogen/
.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
.qtc_clangd/
.qtcreator/
CMakeLists.txt.user*
*.user.*
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
ui_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
*.moc
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.pdb
*.ilk

# Binaries: Qt's DLLs (windeployqt copies them into Build\), caddy.exe (the relay's HTTPS
# front end, ~49 MB - from https://caddyserver.com/download), the installer.
*.exe
*.dll
*.msix

# Patrick's local Qt Creator helpers (windeployqt into Qt Creator's Debug folder, delete
# .qtcreator\ and build\) - machine-specific, not part of the build.
Manager/build.bat
Manager/clean.bat
Notifier/build.bat
Notifier/clean.bat

# The relay server's own data: the live database (cache, installations, the client-id signing
# secret), a migration snapshot, the test database the tests make, Caddy's state, and the real
# Caddyfile (Relay\Caddyfile.example is the shape).
Relay/relay.db
Relay/relay.db-*
Relay/relay.db.*
Relay/test_*.db
Relay/caddy_data/
Relay/caddy_config/
Relay/Caddyfile
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
venv/
*.lnk

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
.idea/

# About-page screenshots that show studio artwork (not ours to publish) - kept on this PC only
Manager/resources/AboutPage3.PNG
Manager/resources/AboutPage4.PNG
